        {
          "text": "Amubambe buzuba bwangu bwa-Sabata, nkaambo bulasalalisya kulindinywe. Kufumbwa uubusofwaazya ncobeni ulafwa. Kufumbwa muntu uubeleka milimo mubuzuba obo, oyo muntu ulatandwa muciinga cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
