              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana ba-Israyeli baleelede kubamba buzuba bwa-Sabata. Babambe Sabata mumazyalani aabo oonse, bube cizuminano citamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
