        {
          "text": "Ncitondezyo citamani akati kesu, mebo abana ba-Israyeli, nkaambo kakuti mamazuba aali musanu abumwi Jehova wakalenga ijulu anyika, pele mubuzuba bwamusanu aabili wakalyokezya akukatalukwa.",
          "type": "text",
